# Target application under test. The Execution Agent requires these.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values (.env is gitignored).
#
# NOTE: On Windows, USERNAME is a built-in OS environment variable (your account
# name). playwright.config.ts loads dotenv with { override: true } so the value
# below wins over the OS one. Do not remove that override or logins will run with
# your Windows account name instead of the app credentials.

# The demo app shown in the QA Orchestrator dashboard:
TARGET_APP_URL=https://www.saucedemo.com
USERNAME=standard_user
PASSWORD=secret_sauce

# --- LLM (Groq) for intelligent requirement + test-case generation ---
# When set, the Requirement Analyzer and Test Case Generator use Groq to produce
# intent-level user stories and concrete, checkable assertions. Without it, they
# fall back to deterministic heuristics. Get a free key: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional — defaults to llama-3.3-70b-versatile
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
